    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Mumbai has many people, trains and taxis. It also has many dogs that live on the streets. Let’s take a walk around and meet the city’s street dogs."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Traffic loves to help the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "traffic",
            "ref": "v-traffic"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "police",
            "ref": "v-police"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". When someone breaks a rule, Traffic runs after the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "vehicle",
            "ref": "v-vehicle"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and stands "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "next to",
            "ref": "v-next-to"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " it. No one can get away under his watch."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Champi lives near a big "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "ground",
            "zh": "开阔的地方"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " where children play "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "cricket",
            "zh": "板球"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and football. Mauryaji, a juice seller, found her. At that time, he was getting a type of "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "head massage",
            "zh": "按摩"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " called champi. That is how she got her name!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Every day, Periappa visits three different restaurants for breakfast, lunch and dinner. He is always eating or "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "dreaming",
            "ref": "v-dream"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " about food."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Kalu loves to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "get around",
            "ref": "v-get-around"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the city. He doesn’t even need a map. On some days, he walks by the sea. On other days, he heads to the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "railway",
            "ref": "v-railway"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " station. He once jumped onto a train when following a friend."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "To learn more about the street dogs of Mumbai, read "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "My City, My Dogs"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " by Abodh Aras."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
